501-**Why the start load should stay small, whatever the window:**
502-- Half of 17 models kept satisfactory performance only up to 32K (RULER, W-10).
503-- 11 models fell below 50% of their baseline at 32K when the question and the answer share few words (NoLiMa, W-11).
504-- Focused prompts of about 300 tokens beat full ones of about 113K (W-13).
505-- Context files raised inference cost by over 20%, with no general success gain (W-17).
506-- At 500 simultaneous instructions, the best model was 68% accurate (W-16).
